    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32109" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκᾰλύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uncover,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ παιδίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.112
				</span></i>
			; <i>disclose, reveal,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργὴ νόον ἐξεκάλυψεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Even.
					5
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντ᾽ ἐκκάλυψον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					195
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1003
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντ᾽ ἐ. ὁ χρόνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					918
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέγ᾽ ἐκκαλύψας κρᾶτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Supp.</u>
				</span></i>
			III; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. μυστικοὺς λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Ir.</u>
					p.46W.
				</span></i>
			: folld. by relat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκάλυπτε..ἡμῖν οὕστινας λέγεις
					λόγους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IA</u>
					872
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Med.
			, <i>uncover one's head, unveil oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				10.179
			</span></i> (tm.): pf.
			fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκκεκαλύψομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					1503
				</span></i>
			 ; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκαλύπτομαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phd.</u>
				118a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>unmask,</i>
			
